      <div class="lp-heading">
        <h2>Hire CallTeam to own the calls and the follow-up.</h2>
        <p>Put CallTeam first when you have a clear B2B offer and want one team accountable for turning calls into qualified sales conversations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sg-two buyer-with-video">
