        <article class="lp-pair-card">
          <h3>27+ new clients for Bellwether Technologies</h3>
          <p>Over 12 months, the campaign helped win clients for Bellwether’s telephone town halls, mass texting and phone polling services.</p>
          <a href="/case-studies/bellwether-technologies-outbound-client-acquisition/">Read the Bellwether case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="lp-small">Learn <a href="/about/">who’s behind CallTeam</a> and see <a href="/awards/">our published awards and recognition</a>.</p>
    </div>
